{"kind":"html","caption":"采用原地穿插法：先把每个新节点插入对应原节点之后，使“原节点 → 副本”关系无需额外哈希表即可定位。随后令副本的 random 指向“原 random 的下一个节点”，最后拆分交错链表，恢复原链表并得到完全独立的深拷贝。动画使用示例 1 展示三个阶段，蓝色节点代表新建副本。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>随机链表的复制</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:14px}body{padding:28px}main{width:100%;max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto}.intro,.panel,.rule{background:#252526;border:1px solid #3d3d3d;border-radius:10px;padding:20px}.intro{margin-bottom:20px}.intro h1{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 10px;color:#fff}.intro p{margin:6px 0;line-height:1.7}.stage{display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;padding:7px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#0e639c;color:#fff;font-weight:600}.panel{margin-bottom:20px}.panel h2{font-size:17px;margin:0 0 16px;color:#fff}.chain{display:flex;align-items:stretch;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;min-height:112px}.node{width:112px;padding:12px 10px;border:2px solid #555;border-radius:8px;background:#2d2d30;transition:background .35s,border-color .35s,opacity .35s}.node.copy{background:#173b57;border-color:#3794ff}.node.focus{background:#0e639c;border-color:#7cc4ff}.value{font:700 20px SFMono-Regular,Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#fff;margin-bottom:8px}.meta{display:grid;gap:5px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35}.idx{color:#b9b9b9}.ptr{font-family:SFMono-Regular,Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#d4d4d4}.arrow{display:flex;align-items:center;color:#888;font-size:20px;min-height:70px}.legend{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:16px;color:#bbb}.dot{display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;margin-right:6px;border-radius:3px;border:2px solid #666;vertical-align:-1px}.dot.copy{background:#173b57;border-color:#3794ff}.explain{margin-top:18px;padding:14px 16px;background:#1c1c1c;border-left:4px solid #3794ff;border-radius:4px;line-height:1.7}.formula{font-family:SFMono-Regular,Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#9cdcfe}.rule{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:16px}.rule-item{padding:14px;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:8px;line-height:1.65}.rule-item strong{display:block;color:#fff;margin-bottom:6px}.muted{color:#9d9d9d}@media(max-width:620px){body{padding:16px}.node{width:100px}.arrow{font-size:16px}}\n  /* COMPACT */ html,body{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.45!important}body{padding:8px 10px 10px!important}main{max-width:560px!important;margin:0 auto!important}.intro,.panel,.rule{padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important;margin-bottom:8px!important;border:1px solid #3c3c3c!important}.intro h1{font-size:14px!important;margin:0 0 4px!important;color:#d4d4d4!important}.intro p{font-size:12px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important;margin:4px 0!important}.stage{padding:2px 7px!important;border-radius:4px!important;font-size:10px!important;margin-top:6px!important}.panel h2{font-size:13px!important;margin:0 0 6px!important}.chain{min-height:72px!important;gap:6px!important}.node{width:68px!important;padding:6px!important;border-width:1px!important;border-radius:6px!important}.value{font-size:13px!important;margin-bottom:4px!important}.meta{font-size:10px!important;gap:3px!important}.explain{border-left-width:3px!important;padding:8px 10px!important;margin-top:8px!important;font-size:12px!important}.rule{display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:1fr!important;gap:6px!important}.rule-item{padding:8px 10px!important;font-size:12px!important}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<section class=\"intro\">\n<h1>随机链表的复制：穿插、连接、拆分</h1>\n<p>示例：<span class=\"formula\">[[7,null],[13,0],[11,4],[10,2],[1,0]]</span></p>\n<p>蓝色节点是全新副本；每个节点内部同时标出索引、<span class=\"formula\">next</span> 与 <span class=\"formula\">random</span>。</p>\n<div class=\"stage\" id=\"stage\">阶段 1 / 3：穿插副本节点</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"panel\">\n<h2 id=\"chainTitle\">交错链表</h2>\n<div class=\"chain\" id=\"chain\"></div>\n<div class=\"legend\"><span><i class=\"dot\"></i>原节点</span><span><i class=\"dot copy\"></i>副本节点</span></div>\n<div class=\"explain\" id=\"explain\"></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"rule\">\n<div class=\"rule-item\"><strong>① 穿插</strong><span class=\"formula\">原节点 → 副本 → 原 next</span><br><span class=\"muted\">副本总在对应原节点的下一位。</span></div>\n<div class=\"rule-item\"><strong>② 复制 random</strong><span class=\"formula\">副本.random = 原.random.next</span><br><span class=\"muted\">若原 random 为空，副本也为空。</span></div>\n<div class=\"rule-item\"><strong>③ 拆分</strong>分别串起奇偶位置节点。<br><span class=\"muted\">原链表恢复，副本链表独立。</span></div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst vals=[7,13,11,10,1], random=[null,0,4,2,0];\nconst chain=document.getElementById('chain'),stage=document.getElementById('stage'),explain=document.getElementById('explain'),title=document.getElementById('chainTitle');\nfunction card(i,isCopy,next,rand,focus=false){const d=document.createElement('div');d.className='node'+(isCopy?' copy':'')+(focus?' focus':'');const tag=isCopy?i+\"′\":String(i);d.innerHTML='<div class=\"value\">'+vals[i]+'</div><div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"idx\">'+(isCopy?'副本':'原节点')+'索引 '+tag+'</span><span class=\"ptr\">next → '+next+'</span><span class=\"ptr\">random → '+rand+'</span></div>';return d}\nfunction addArrow(){const a=document.createElement('div');a.className='arrow';a.textContent='→';chain.appendChild(a)}\nfunction render(step){chain.innerHTML='';if(step===0){stage.textContent='阶段 1 / 3：穿插副本节点';title.textContent='交错链表';for(let i=0;i<vals.length;i++){chain.appendChild(card(i,false,i+\"′\",random[i]===null?'null':random[i]));addArrow();chain.appendChild(card(i,true,i===vals.length-1?'null':i+1,'待设置',i===2));if(i<vals.length-1)addArrow()}explain.innerHTML='在每个原节点后创建副本。于是原节点 <span class=\"formula\">i</span> 的副本可直接由 <span class=\"formula\">i.next</span> 找到，不需要额外映射表。'}else if(step===1){stage.textContent='阶段 2 / 3：连接副本的 random';title.textContent='交错链表中的 random 映射';for(let i=0;i<vals.length;i++){chain.appendChild(card(i,false,i+\"′\",random[i]===null?'null':random[i]));addArrow();const rr=random[i]===null?'null':random[i]+\"′\";chain.appendChild(card(i,true,i===vals.length-1?'null':i+1,rr,i===2));if(i<vals.length-1)addArrow()}explain.innerHTML='例如原节点 <span class=\"formula\">2.random → 4</span>。节点 4 的副本就在它后面，因此得到 <span class=\"formula\">2′.random → 4′</span>；所有副本指针都落在副本节点上。'}else{stage.textContent='阶段 3 / 3：拆分并恢复';title.textContent='得到独立的副本链表';for(let i=0;i<vals.length;i++){const nx=i===vals.length-1?'null':(i+1)+\"′\";const rr=random[i]===null?'null':random[i]+\"′\";chain.appendChild(card(i,true,nx,rr,i===2));if(i<vals.length-1)addArrow()}explain.innerHTML='依次恢复原节点的 <span class=\"formula\">next</span>，同时把副本节点串起。最终副本的值、next 与 random 结构相同，但没有任何指针指向原链表。'}}\nlet step=0;render(step);setInterval(()=>{step=(step+1)%3;render(step)},2600);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
